OL,3,CConstruction of Chinese super embassy
OL,4,Cin London to go ahead
OL,6,FThe construction of a new Chinese
OL,7,Fsuper embassy in London can go ahead
OL,8,Fafter a High Court challenge against
OL,9,Fthe original planning decision was
OL,10,Fdismissed.
OL,12,FThe Royal Mint Court Residents'
OL,13,FAssociation (RMCRA) brought legal
OL,14,Faction against the Ministry of
OL,15,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,16,FGovernment (MHCLG) and the London
OL,17,FBorough of Tower Hamlets.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
