OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785523715
OL,3,CConstruction of Chinese super embassy
OL,4,Cin London to go ahead
OL,6,FIt said the presence of the embassy,
OL,7,Fwith a site earmarked near the Tower
OL,8,Fof London, could lead to terrorist
OL,9,Fattacks or the repression of protests,
OL,10,Fwhile being used to enforce
OL,11,F"draconian" Chinese laws in the UK and
OL,12,Fto target dissidents.
OL,14,FThe RMCRA, which represents families
OL,15,Fand businesses in about 100
OL,16,Fproperties, was also concerned about
OL,17,Fthe Chinese government creating a fire
OL,18,Frisk by ignoring safety obligations,
OL,19,Fwhich it said would not be enforceable
OL,20,Fbecause of diplomatic immunity.
