OL,4,Cin London to go ahead
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe original planning application was
OL,12,Fmet with concern about proximity to
OL,13,FThe City, London's banking and trade
OL,14,Fhub and the subsequent security risks.
OL,16,FThe Government and the council
OL,17,Fdefended the claim, saying they
OL,18,F"conscientiously and carefully had
OL,19,Fregard" to the residents' concerns.
